um captures the disaffection and anger felt by the youth of the UK's \"concrete jungle\" - a phrase borrowed from Bob Marley's 1972 album Catch A Fire but equally apposite used here to describe the grim, violent inner cities of 1970s Britain. Musically, the album encapsulates the wave of British ska, greatly reworking the original sound of 1960s Jamaican ska. .", "desc_artist": "The Specials is an English “2 Tone” ska revival band  formed in 1977 in Coventry, Warwickshire. Their music combines a danceable ska beat with punk’s energy, underpinned by an informed political and social stance. \n\nThe group was formed by songwriter/keyboardist Jerry Dammers, with Terry Hall (vocals), Lynval Golding (guitar, vocals) and a rhythm section featuring Horace Panter (bass) and John Bra"}}, {"id": 547, "num": "0537", "genre": "Pre-Classical", "rec": "Domenico Scarlatti - 22 Sonates (1735-1757)", "cat": "WESTERN CLASSICAL", "fam": "Classical", "yt": "https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Domenico+Scarlatti+-+22+Sonates", "x": 1360, "y": 994, "rel_out": [], "alb": {"album_name": "Spiel nicht mit den Schmuddelkindern", "year": 1965, "artist_name": "Franz Josef Degenhardt"}}, {"id": 548, "num": "0538", "genre": "Classical Period", "rec": "Christoph Willibald Gluck - Orfeo ed Euridice (1762)", "cat": "WESTERN CLASSICAL", "fam": "Classical", "yt": "https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Christoph+Willibald+Gluck+-+Orfeo+ed+Euridice", "x": 1620, "y": 994, "rel_out": [], "alb": {"album_name": "Spiritual Unity", "year": 1965, "artist_name": "Albert Ayler Trio", "cover_url": "https://ia800807.us.archive.org/5/items/mbid-05c9bbed-8586-4ef0-9d53-73483688db87/mbid-05c9bbed-8586-4ef0-9d53-73483688db87-5499852465.jpg", "rateyourmusic_url": "https://rateyourmusic.com/release/album/albert-ayler-trio/spiritual-unity/", "desc_artist": "Albert Ayler's Trio created a definitive free jazz sound. Assembled in New York together with double bassist Gary Peacock and drummer Sunny Murray, they've recorded their breakthrough album called Spiritual Unity, for ESP-Disk Records: 30 minutes of intense free improvisation. Embraced by New York jazz leaders like Eric Dolphy, who reportedly called him the best player he'd ever seen, Ayler found "}}, {"id": 549, "num": "0539", "genre": "Mannheim School", "rec": "Various - Mannheim - The Golden Age (1751-1775)", "cat": "WESTERN CLASSICAL", "fam": "Classical", "yt": "https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Various+-+Mannheim+-+The+Golden+Age", "x": 320, "y": 1124, "rel_out": [], "alb": {"album_name": "Splendid Jubilant New Year: The Collection of Classic Chinese Festival Music", "year": 2004, "artist_name": "The Chinese Orchestra of Shanghai Conservatory, Xiao‐Peng Jiang"}}, {"id": 550, "num": "0540", "genre": "Viennese Classical", "rec": "Joseph Haydn - Symphonies Nos. 6, 7 & 8 (1761)", "cat": "WESTERN CLASSICAL", "fam": "Classical", "yt": "https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Joseph+Haydn+-+Symphonies+Nos.+6%2C+7+%26+8", "x": 580, "y": 1124, "rel_out": ["0541", "0542", "0543", "0544", "0545", "0546", "0547", "0548", "0549", "0551"], "alb": {"album_name": "Šta je to u tvojim venama", "year": 1993, "artist_name": "Ceca"}}, {"id": 551, "num": "0541", "genre": "Viennese Classical", "rec": "Joseph Haydn - String Quartets, Op. 20 (1772)", "cat": "WESTERN CLASSICAL", "fam": "Classical", "yt": "https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Joseph+Haydn+-+String+Quartets%2C+Op.+20", "x": 840, "y": 1124, "rel_out": [], "alb": {"album_name": "Stabat Mater", "artist_name": "Giovanni Battista Pergolesi"}}, {"id": 552, "num": "0542", "genre": "Classical Period", "rec": "Muzio Clementi - Piano Music [Naxos, 8.550452] (1790-1798)", "cat": "WESTERN CLASSICAL", "fam": "Classical", "yt": "https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Muzio+Clementi+-+Piano+Music+%5BNaxos%2C+8.550452%5D", "x": 1100, "y": 1124, "rel_out": [], "alb": {"album_name": "Stars of Ghana", "year": 1962, "artist_name": "Various Artists", "artist_mb