ttps://rateyourmusic.com/release/album/bohren-and-der-club-of-gore/sunset-mission", "desc_album": "Sunset Mission is the third full-length record from Bohren & der Club of Gore. It is their first album to feature sax player Christoph Clöser, more explicitly exploring jazz than earlier recordings. The liner notes include a quote from Matt Wagner's Grendel comic book, which reads: \"Alone in the comforting darkness the creature waits. As confusion reigns on this hellish stage, the deafening grind of machinery, the odious clot of chemical waste. Still, the trail of his ultimate prey leads through this steely maze to these, the addled offspring of the modern world.\" .", "desc_artist": "Bohren & der Club of Gore are a noir jazz band founded in 1992 in Mülheim an der Ruhr, Germany by Thorsten Benning (drums), Morten Gass (keys), Reiner Henseleit (guitar), and Robin Rodenberg (upright / double bass). They play a crossover of jazz and ambient, which they self described as an \"unholy ambient mixture of slow jazz ballads, Black Sabbath doom and down tuned Autopsy sounds\". Over the yea", "scaruffi_rating": 7.5}}, {"id": 568, "num": "0558", "genre": "Middle German Romantic", "rec": "Richard Wagner - Tristan und Isolde (1859)", "cat": "WESTERN CLASSICAL", "fam": "Romantic", "yt": "https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Richard+Wagner+-+Tristan+und+Isolde", "x": 320, "y": 1514, "rel_out": [], "alb": {"album_name": "Super Hits", "year": 1981, "artist_name": "Various Artists", "artist_mb": "https://musicbrainz.org/artist/89ad4ac3-39f7-470e-963a-56509c546377", "artist_wiki": "https://cs.wikipedia.org/wiki/Různí_interpreti"}}, {"id": 569, "num": "0559", "genre": "Middle German Romantic", "rec": "Johannes Brahms - A German Requiem (1868)", "cat": "WESTERN CLASSICAL", "fam": "Romantic", "yt": "https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Johannes+Brahms+-+A+German+Requiem", "x": 580, "y": 1514, "rel_out": [], "alb": {"album_name": "Swedish Folk Songs & Ballads", "year": 1954, 