rist, and singer. Often regarded as one of the greatest songwriters of all time, Dylan has been a major figure in popular culture during a career spanning more than 60 years.\n\nDylan started his musical odyssey in 1959 when he began playing in Dinkytown, Minneapolis whi"}}, {"id": 623, "num": "0613", "genre": "Post-Minimalism", "rec": "John Adams - Nixon in China (1987)", "cat": "WESTERN CLASSICAL", "fam": "Postmodern", "yt": "https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=John+Adams+-+Nixon+in+China", "x": 320, "y": 2684, "rel_out": [], "alb": {"album_name": "The Gioconda Smile", "year": 1985, "artist_name": "Poésie Noire"}}, {"id": 624, "num": "0614", "genre": "Totalism", "rec": "Glenn Branca - Symphony No. 1 - Tonal Plexus (1981)", "cat": "WESTERN CLASSICAL", "fam": "Postmodern", "yt": "https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Glenn+Branca+-+Symphony+No.+1+-+Tonal+Plexus", "x": 580, "y": 2684, "rel_out": [], "alb": {"album_name": "The Girls", "year": 2010, "artist_name": "Various Artists", "artist_mb": "https://musicbrainz.org/artist/89ad4ac3-39f7-470e-963a-56509c546377", "artist_wiki": "https://cs.wikipedia.org/wiki/Různí_interpreti"}}, {"id": 625, "num": "0615", "genre": "Classical Marches", "rec": "Various - 40 Famous Marches (1999)", "cat": "WESTERN CLASSICAL", "fam": "Other", "yt": "https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Various+-+40+Famous+Marches", "x": 840, "y": 2684, "rel_out": [], "alb": {"album_name": "The Great British Dance Bands", "artist_name": "Various Artists", "artist_mb": "https://musicbrainz.org/artist/89ad4ac3-39f7-470e-963a-56509c546377", "artist_wiki": "https://cs.wikipedia.org/wiki/Různí_interpreti"}}, {"id": 626, "num": "0616", "genre": "Pasodoble", "rec": "Banda Taurina - The Brave Bulls (1954)", "cat": "WESTERN CLASSICAL", "fam": "Other", "yt": "https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Banda+Taurina+-+The+Brave+Bulls", "x": 1100, "y": 2684, "rel_out": [], "alb": {"album_name": "The Heavenly Orchestra of Bali", "year": 1991,