 was the saxophonist in The Dave Brubeck Quartet. Due to the immense popularity of his work, Brubeck ", "aoty_user_score": 84}}, {"id": 665, "num": "0655", "genre": "Swing", "rec": "Various - An Anthology of Big Band Swing (1930-1955)", "cat": "JAZZ", "fam": "Big Band", "yt": "https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Various+-+An+Anthology+of+Big+Band+Swing", "x": 2270, "y": 734, "rel_out": [], "alb": {"album_name": "Tomb Raider (Original Motion Picture Soundtrack)", "year": 2018, "artist_name": "Tom Holkenborg aka Junkie XL"}}, {"id": 666, "num": "0656", "genre": "Swing", "rec": "Benny Goodman - Carnegie Hall Jazz Concert (1938)", "cat": "JAZZ", "fam": "Big Band", "yt": "https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Benny+Goodman+-+Carnegie+Hall+Jazz+Concert", "x": 2530, "y": 734, "rel_out": [], "alb": {"album_name": "Tonico & Tinoco", "year": 1998, "artist_name": "Tonico & Tinoco"}}, {"id": 667, "num": "0657", "genre": "Swing", "rec": "Artie Shaw - Plays an Album of Popular Music (1939)", "cat": "JAZZ", "fam": "Big Band", "yt": "https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Artie+Shaw+-+Plays+an+Album+of+Popular+Music", "x": 2790, "y": 734, "rel_out": [], "alb": {"album_name": "Town Hall, New York City, June 22, 1945", "year": 2005, "artist_name": "Charlie Parker & Dizzy Gillespie"}}, {"id": 668, "num": "0658", "genre": "Swing", "rec": "Frank Sinatra - Swing Easy! (1954)", "cat": "JAZZ", "fam": "Big Band", "yt": "https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Frank+Sinatra+-+Swing+Easy%21", "x": 3050, "y": 734, "rel_out": [], "alb": {"album_name": "Traditional Folk Music", "artist_name": "Various Artists", "artist_mb": "https://musicbrainz.org/artist/89ad4ac3-39f7-470e-963a-56509c546377", "artist_wiki": "https://cs.wikipedia.org/wiki/Různí_interpreti"}}, {"id": 669, "num": "0659", "genre": "Swing", "rec": "Count Basie and His Orchestra + Neal Hefti Arrangements - Basie (1958)", "cat": "JAZZ", "fam": "Big Band", "yt": "https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=C